1) To update image, remove existing and pull again
   docker image rm ebiglygen/mapper-java-jar:basic
   docker pull ebiglygen/mapper-java-jar:basic


2) Usage with request object
   save the example json in a file (tests/temp/q.json) then run http POST

   {
	"jobtype": "isoform_mapper",
	"parameters":{},
	"intable":[
		["isoform_ac","amino_acid_pos","amino_acid"],
		["A6NJB7-2","3","T"],
		["A6NJB7-2","8","S"]
	]
   }

   $ http POST :8082/job/addnew/ < tests/temp/q.json  


3) Usage with uploaded file
   save input csv file (tmp/input.csv) and run test_isoform_mapper.py

   isoform_ac,amino_acid_pos,amino_acid
   A6NJB7-2,3,T
   A6NJB7-2,8,S
   P08697-2,36,T
   P08697-2,37,S
   P19827-2,514,S
   P19827-2,516,N
   P19827-2,517,T

   $ python3 test_isoform_mapper.py



